{"bbox": [61.55976867675781, 343.5859680175781, 424.980224609375, 362.18035888671875], "text": "I must go down to the seas again, to the lonely sea and the sky,", "page_number": 4}
{"bbox": [61.036468505859375, 371.70697021484375, 357.4646301269531, 388.5702819824219], "text": "And all I ask is a tall ship and a star to steer her by ;", "page_number": 4}
{"bbox": [60.83707046508789, 398.1315002441406, 461.9831237792969, 414.5353698730469], "text": "And the wheel's kick and the wind's song and the white sail's shaking,", "page_number": 4}
{"bbox": [60.315067291259766, 424.3755187988281, 411.8712158203125, 440.9494323730469], "text": "And a grey mist on the sea's face, and a grey dawn breaking.", "page_number": 4}
{"bbox": [60.84796905517578, 457.5987243652344, 425.7414245605469, 473.8726806640625], "text": "I must go down to the seas again, for the call of the running tide", "page_number": 4}
{"bbox": [60.31536865234375, 484.2704772949219, 415.35125732421875, 505.66448974609375], "text": "Is a wild call and a clear call that may not be denied; \np,", "page_number": 4}
{"bbox": [58.762367248535156, 510.89093017578125, 395.1517333984375, 526.8884887695312], "text": "And all I ask is a windy day with the white clouds flying [!l", "page_number": 4}
{"bbox": [58.560367584228516, 537.6678466796875, 446.6075134277344, 553.6705932617188], "text": "And the flung spray and the blown spume, and the sea-gulls crying.", "page_number": 4}
{"bbox": [58.419368743896484, 571.400390625, 394.708251953125, 587.9705810546875], "text": "I must go down to the seas again, to the vagrant gypsy life", "page_number": 4}
{"bbox": [57.53767013549805, 597.7686767578125, 493.06085205078125, 614.23876953125], "text": "To the gull's way and the whale's way where the wind's like a whetted knife", "page_number": 4}
{"bbox": [56.31406784057617, 624.790283203125, 385.8046569824219, 641.607177734375], "text": "And all I ask is a merry yarn from a laughing fellow rover,", "page_number": 4}
{"bbox": [55.45787048339844, 641.07421875, 463.382080078125, 672.6845703125], "text": "\u0002\u0003[!)\nAnd quiet sleep and a sweet dream when the long trick's over. \nqr", "page_number": 4}
